Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:45.41,OP - Rom,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.5}kimi ni maji de ii janai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:49.04,OP - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5}Aku ingin melihat senyummu yang indah (Ya!)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:49.04,OP - Rom,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.5}tobikiri no egao ga mitai   (Yes!)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:53.75,OP - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5}Kau hanya perlu membuat jawabannya benar (selalu begitu)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:53.75,OP - Rom,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.5}seikai nante tsukureba ii dake sa   (itsudatte sou)
